  "ingredients": [
    "1.75 cups white sugar",
    "1 cup water",
    "9 medium lemons, or more as needed",
    "7 cups ice-cold water",
    "ice as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/G7Z7tDSqvFUdScK-bG4w1fS7MwU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/32385-best-lemonade-ever-step-01.-6adadf4d42d54042b65f63e038f18874.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/32385/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine sugar and 1 cup water in a small saucepan. Stir to dissolve sugar while mixture comes to a boil. Set aside to cool slightly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cg1zSk47zEFRN1r6hy4O7s_-CWU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/32385-best-lemonade-ever-step-3-171-a3e8cf6953c249cdb44c5814dbbb92b1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/32385/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, roll lemons around on your counter to soften. Cut in half crosswise, and squeeze into a liquid measuring cup. Add pulp to the juice, but discard any seeds. Continue juicing until you have 1 ½ cups fresh juice and pulp.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/I9pAkKLN2USMOl-IE3oSgKyCoQg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/32385-best-lemonade-ever-step-4-179-fc0bd72c3f534fcc821e5954fe0fecee.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/32385/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour 7 cups ice-cold water into a pitcher. Stir in lemon juice and pulp, then add simple syrup to taste. Add ice.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nX7YuEi-TCxGpA1Mbh11jp0NXNw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/32385-best-lemonade-ever-step-5-186-4b3caf581d6c4f6084c01077a4d6e09a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/32385/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
